                            <comment id="15607980" author="fvaleri" created="Wed, 26 Oct 2016 09:28:41 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I still have this problem on each rebase.&lt;br/&gt;
I&apos;am on Windows7 without proxy but I can&apos;t download google-web-fonts.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The only way to complete zeppelin-web build is to comment &apos;goog-webfont-dl&apos; in Gruntfile.js or add --force in frontend-maven-plugin (but I don&apos;t like it beacuse it applies to all grunt build tasks).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ve found this: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/gruntjs/grunt-contrib-imagemin/issues/321&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/gruntjs/grunt-contrib-imagemin/issues/321&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
But it doesn&apos;t work.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15646426" author="wizfinder" created="Tue, 8 Nov 2016 04:10:12 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;In \zeppelin-web\node_modules\grunt\node_modules\grunt-legacy-util\index.js, line 182&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    //args = opts.args || [];&lt;br/&gt;
    cmd = process.execPath;&lt;br/&gt;
    args = [].concat(opts.cmd, opts.args);&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I edit the code and it works. &lt;br/&gt;
so, I&apos;m afraid that goog-webfont-dl or grunt-legacy-util don&apos;t supports on windows7.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15646999" author="fvaleri" created="Tue, 8 Nov 2016 09:22:18 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I confirm that it works with your hints.&lt;br/&gt;
Probably it is a grunt problem that must be investigated.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The zeppelin-web module build is always tricky from a Windows env (not my choise).&lt;br/&gt;
I think it&apos;s important to have a clean build in order to foster enteprise adoption. &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
