&lt;p&gt;    &apos;spawn UNKNOWN&apos; error occurs on zeppelin-web build processing in windows 7.&lt;br/&gt;
    It due to the function &apos;grunt.util.spawn()&apos; which is called by the module &apos;grunt-goog-webfont-dl&apos;.&lt;br/&gt;
    So I changed this module to &apos;grunt-google-fonts&apos;.&lt;/p&gt;

