&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;commit 1fea68fe08b06f7c5215dc54c5601d52d9386bbf&lt;br/&gt;
Author: Myoungdo Park &amp;lt;cuspymd@gmail.com&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Date:   2016-12-06T16:12:59Z&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Change google font downloader to fix a build error in win 7&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Curruntly &apos;spawn UNKNOWN&apos; error occurs on zeppelin-web build processing in windows 7.&lt;br/&gt;
    It due to the function &apos;grunt.util.spawn()&apos; which is called by the module &apos;grunt-goog-webfont-dl&apos;.&lt;br/&gt;
    So I changed this module to &apos;grunt-google-fonts&apos;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr /&gt;</comment>
