                            <comment id="15727314" author="githubbot" created="Wed, 7 Dec 2016 01:23:14 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user cuspymd commented on the issue:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/1731&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/1731&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    @bzz Thanks for your comment. The file &apos;google-fonts.css&apos; is created during zeppelin-web build. &lt;br/&gt;
    You need to run `npm run build`.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15728895" author="githubbot" created="Wed, 7 Dec 2016 14:26:09 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user cuspymd commented on the issue:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/1731&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/1731&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    @bzz I have checked it works in dev mode after grunt build.&lt;br/&gt;
